architecture catalogue-release-review
  canonical_name CatalogueReleaseReview
  family surface
  domain Content / Catalogue and room release review
  maturity implemented
  semantic_question Which exact saved product changes affect the retained room plans, and can authorized members stage and review that snapshot without overwriting concurrent work?
  purpose Extend the existing catalogue workspace with merchant-specific releases, source comparisons, room budget impact, revision-checked review annotations and exact saved-record continuation.
  internal_calculus Immutable selected draft snapshots and canonical content digests
  internal_calculus Exact source URL, product and option identity joins across retained fixture catalogues
  internal_calculus Per-placement exact-cent price deltas with source-observation and baseline checks
  internal_calculus Atomic check-only dependency revisions and release-record compare-and-swap
  internal_calculus Native idempotent request replay after uncertain save responses
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/planner-model.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/planner-spatial-model.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/planner-spatial.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/planner-client.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-release.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-release-view.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-client.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-material.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/sections/catalogue.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue.css
  source_path scripts/materialize_catalogue_release_repair.mjs
  source_path scripts/materialize_room_scale_repair.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/planner.css
  source_path scripts/materialize_workspace_package.mjs
  source_path scripts/publish_experience_setups.mjs
  source_path packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/material.mjs
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/catalogue-release.test.mjs checks exact identity joins, repeated placements, unknown collections, changed sources, stale review and tampered release bodies
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/catalogue-release-native.test.mjs builds the real ServiceSite material and exercises isolated Auth, CMS and WebAddress owners for continuation, shared review, atomic dependency checks, current roles and lost-response replay
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/planner-scale.test.mjs checks forty placements, shared sixty-four placement limits, exact-cent budgets, unsafe total refusal and stale release review
  witness scripts/tests/room-scale-native-browser.test.mjs exercises forty-placement layout edits, native reopen, release staging, review and changed-room refusal at desktop and narrow widths
  witness scripts/tests/room-scale-retained-browser.test.mjs exercises the exact retained package repair through native storage when BONFYRE_ROOM_BASE_ROOT is provided
  witness scripts/tests/room-scale-repair.test.mjs verifies historical module bytes and unrelated package members remain unchanged
  witness scripts/tests/catalogue-release-retained-browser.test.mjs checks the retained native catalogue, merchant IDs, forty-placement price impact, shared review, stale dependencies, lost acknowledgements and unresolved source observations when BONFYRE_ROOM_BASE_ROOT is provided
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-room-model.mjs
  source_path scripts/materialize_room_quantity_repair.mjs
  witness scripts/tests/room-quantity-retained.test.mjs checks catalogue placement into a forty-item native room, sixty-four item quantities, overflow refusal and native reopen at desktop and narrow widths
  invariant Plan validation, catalogue placement, quantity editing and retained release impact share a sixty-four placement limit
  invariant Product and room draft records remain unchanged by staging and reviewing a release
  invariant A release contains one merchant catalogue and exact saved product and room revisions; no title matching supplies an identity
  invariant Unknown fixture collections and different source observations prevent completed review; unresolved price totals remain null
  invariant Every known dependency revision is checked in the same native transaction as the release save
  invariant Refresh produces a staged snapshot and clears the prior review annotation
  invariant The review annotation does not assert approver identity or grant publication authority
  invariant The release record uses the existing spaces family and Pack-declared release:catalogue: prefix
  forbidden_inference staged or reviewed release -> merchant publication, procurement commitment, supplier acceptance or authenticated approval
  forbidden_inference exact checks for known room revisions -> an atomic snapshot of all possible rooms created concurrently
  forbidden_inference native integration tests or a successful public build -> verified desktop or mobile rendering, host integration or live deployment
  known_gap The larger placement bound does not add multi-room geometry, merchant ingestion, procurement or source reconciliation
  known_gap The public easel and fixture planner retain different capture hashes; source reconciliation is required before their release review can finish
  known_gap Assets, page content, localization, attributed approvals and merchant publication are not part of this release transaction yet
  known_gap New room records created after enumeration are outside the snapshot; refresh is required to include them
  known_gap Fictional-source native browser tests cover desktop and narrow forty-placement flows; full accessibility, all failures and live source reconciliation remain unverified
  invariant The retained release projection preserves native scene, docking, collection history and existing source package bytes; new modules have new immutable paths
  forbidden_inference Bounded merchant identifier syntax -> a verified merchant identity or current source price
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/workspace-lifetime.mjs
  source_path integrations/browser/workspace-store.mjs
  source_path integrations/browser/workspace-continuation.mjs
  source_path scripts/materialize_catalogue_account_repair.mjs
  source_path scripts/materialize_planner_account_repair.mjs
  witness scripts/tests/planner-account-browser.test.mjs checks native room account closure, held controls, delayed reads, exactly-once committed saves, scene disposal and current-account reload in both retained collections
  invariant Both retained room collections share document lifetime, guarded native storage and disposal of private plans, project choices, history and spatial scenes
  invariant Account changes and pagehide permanently close the catalogue document; queued storage operations and late responses cannot publish private record projections
  witness integrations/browser/tests/workspace-lifetime.test.mjs checks abort boundaries, queued writes and delayed private response bodies
  witness scripts/tests/catalogue-account-browser.test.mjs exercises retained catalogue account closure and current-account reload through isolated native owners
  known_gap Event-driven pagehide tests do not prove every browser back-forward cache lifecycle or unrelated editor closure
  interacts catalogue-release-uses-native-workspace
  interacts service-site-renders-catalogue-release

interaction catalogue-release-uses-native-workspace
  source catalogue-release-review
  destination web-address-edge
  relation revision-checked-release-review
  preserves Current session, destination, installation, roles, exact dependency revisions, saved release identity and native idempotency
  drops Application-owned record databases and inferred permission to publish merchant content
  forbidden_inference Native release save -> authority to publish or change a merchant account
  invalidates_on Pack prefix declarations, native check-only semantics, record schema, current role or package continuation changes
  binding components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-release.mjs
  binding scripts/publish_experience_setups.mjs
  binding scripts/materialize_workspace_package.mjs
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/catalogue-release-native.test.mjs

interaction service-site-renders-catalogue-release
  source service-site
  destination catalogue-release-review
  relation catalogue-and-fixture-material
  preserves Existing catalogue editing, planner validation, source digests, store identity, theme and shared storage selection
  drops Unverified matching by product title or inferred live merchant prices
  forbidden_inference Prepared static material -> account-scoped persistence or verified current source prices
  invalidates_on Catalogue material, fixture catalogue digest, planner model or browser store binding changes
  binding components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-material.mjs
  binding components/BonfyreServiceSite/catalogue-client.mjs
  binding packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/material.mjs
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/catalogue-release.test.mjs
